WEBVTT

00:02:31.022 --> 00:02:34.692
There are giving circles
with five members or 500,

00:02:34.692 --> 00:02:38.613
each person giving
five dollars or 250,000,

00:02:38.613 --> 00:02:42.491
iIncluding any generation,
identity or geography.

00:02:43.117 --> 00:02:45.119
We give to nonprofits,

00:02:45.119 --> 00:02:46.579
we give to individuals

00:02:46.621 --> 00:02:49.123
or to new projects
just getting off the ground.

00:02:49.874 --> 00:02:51.959
There are women's giving circles

00:02:52.001 --> 00:02:53.836
and Black giving circles,

00:02:53.878 --> 00:02:56.923
Jewish, Muslim and interfaith.

00:02:57.381 --> 00:02:59.717
Giving circles that focus
on climate change

00:02:59.759 --> 00:03:01.302
and civic engagement.